        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A later account lists menses blood Gu among Blood Sea Ancestor’s nine true inheritances at Gu Immortal level, and states that Northern Plains’ menses blood Immortal Gu was obtained by Dong Fang Chang Fan.",
